{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mace","model_identifier":"mace","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## mace\n\nOne-handed weapon, iron grades.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..3.0, y -3.0..3.0, z -26.0..4.2 (size 6.0 x 6.0 x 30.2 u = 17 x 17 x 85 cm).\nIron flanged mace, about 70 cm (30 u): a head of four flanges (cross of two thin plates round a core), iron-shod haft (iron strip sleeve) with a leather grip. Grip at the origin, head 18.5-26 u forward (-Z). One-handed. Iron grade textures.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `mace_iron_bloom.png`, `mace_iron_wrought.png`, `mace_iron_refined.png`\n"},"description":"## mace\n\nOne-handed weapon, iron grades.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..3.0, y -3.0..3.0, z -26.0..4.2 (size 6.0 x 6.0 x 30.2 u = 17 x 17 x 85 cm).\nIron flanged mace, about 70 cm (30 u): a head of four flanges (cross of two thin plates round a core), iron-shod haft (iron strip sleeve) with a leather grip. Grip at the origin, head 18.5-26 u forward (-Z). One-handed. Iron grade textures.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `mace_iron_bloom.png`, `mace_iron_wrought.png`, `mace_iron_refined.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"haft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-0.6,-17.0],"to":[0.6,0.6,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,30,9.2,31.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,26,20.0,27.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10,30,11.2,31